    "application": "BambuStudio-02.08.02.61",
    "profile_title": "Double Chain for New Interesting Shapes",
    "profile_notes": "Huge thanks to the original designer for this brilliant model! This profile contains the original model duplicated on the build plate, colored with four colors. By linking the two chains together into one long chain, you can experiment with additional exciting 3D shapes. Check out the photos for inspiration! Note on the hinges: This profile uses the original, super smooth-moving hinges. While this extreme looseness is a huge advantage for the original model, it makes 3D sculpting a bit trickier here, as the chain struggles to hold its shape in the air. Therefore, some shapes can only be assembled by building them flat on a table. An exciting future improvement for the long chain would be to make the hinges tighter so the assembled shapes remain more stable.",
